:''Not to be confused with [[Kabuto Cat (Switch Special Cat)]] or [[Kuwagata Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Kabuto Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] using Legend Nets. It was added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 615
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Kabuto Cat
|name2 = Golden Kabuto Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Golden Kabuto Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kabuto Cat can be seen as a lesser version of [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Viking Cat]] with [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] as an extra target. Stat-wise, it is rather mediocre, but, with enough grinding, its + levels can make him worthwhile for most of the game. Its stats, early on, are relatively good, but it should still be used in stages that do not feature major threats of other traits.

Its lackluster damage makes it mainly a meatshield, but, thanks to his strength, speed and recharge, it can do a good job and may prove extremely important in some 4-crowns [[Legend Stages]], even better if paired with research combos or Thor Cat.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

